<title>USA: TVA Watts Bar nuclear unit at 97 pct power.</title>
<headline>TVA Watts Bar nuclear unit at 97 pct power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>TVA Nuclear's 1,170 megawatt (MW) Watts Bar nuclear power unit restarted and was operating at 97 percent of capacity early this morning, Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Monday.</p>
<p>The plant, in Spring City, Tenn., shut down last Monday when restart from a previous outage was aborted after a leak was discovered in a main condenser tube.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
